T*
(OM-2300 PAGE 3 OF 5 - SECTION 3: NORMAL PLANNED SHUTDOWN & CUMENE FLUSH PROCEDURE) Tj
T*
(Step 1: Ramp down Concentrated CHP feed \(Stream S229\) from V-2301 / P-2301A to zero while maintaining D-2304 circulation \(Stream S379\) and acid catalyst for 15 minutes until residual CHP < 0.05 wt%.) Tj
T*
(Step 2: Close Sulfuric Acid Catalyst Valve XV-1305 and flush feed nozzles with pure Cumene.) Tj
T*
(Step 3: Cool D-2304 loop to < 45 degC via E-2307 before stopping Circulation Pump P-2304A.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
