T*
(OM-2300 PAGE 4 OF 5 - SECTION 4: EMERGENCY SHUTDOWN \(INTERLOCK I-2304 & QUENCH ACTIVATION\)) Tj
T*
(When D-2304 temperature reaches 92.0 degC \(TAH-1301\):) Tj
T*
(- Board Operator Action: Immediately verify TV-1302 is 100% open and reduce P-2301A CHP feed rate by 50%.) Tj
T*
(When D-2304 temperature reaches 115.0 degC \(TXSHH-1301 2oo3 voting\) or Pressure reaches 5.5 kg/cm2g \(PAHH-1301\):) Tj
T*
(- Automatic SIL-2 Interlock I-2304 Action:) Tj
T*
(  1. Closes Sulfuric Acid Valve XV-1305 \(< 2 sec\).) Tj
T*
(  2. Stops CHP Feed Pump P-2301A/B.) Tj
T*
(  3. Opens Emergency Cumene Quench Valve XV-1309 \(Stream S387\), flooding D-2304 with cold Cumene to drop temperature below 65 degC and dilute peroxides.) Tj
T*
(  4. Keeps Circulation Pump P-2304A running and E-2307 Cooling Valve TV-1302 100% open to maximize heat removal.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
