(OM-2300 PAGE 5 OF 5 - SECTION 5: OPERATOR VERIFICATION OF DESIGN PRESSURE CONFLICT \(D-2304\)) Tj
T*
(- Notice to Operations & Process Safety Engineers:) Tj
T*
(  * Authoritative Process Data Sheet DS-D2304 specifies D-2304 Internal Design Pressure = 11.0 kg/cm2g \(matching PSV-2304A/B set pressure of 11.0 kg/cm2g on DS-PS-0018\).) Tj
T*
(  * P&ID Drawing PID-23-0013 title block carries a conflicting annotation of 12.2 kg/cm2g.) Tj
T*
(  * Operating limit governance strictly enforces the lower 11.0 kg/cm2g MAWP rating per Corporate Standard STD-ENG-014.) Tj
T*
